user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T14:32:37-07:00","id":1114279,"title":"","content":"Very excited!<br /> <br /> (I'm always very excited when posts related to this game come up)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T14:24:02-07:00","id":1114752,"title":"","content":"IC post up!<br /> <br /> I think everyone but Guan has something big to be getting on with this month, but feel free to chip in if you want to do a side project as well considering the latest. I'll sort Guan with something don't worry!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T15:39:25-07:00","id":1124041,"title":"","content":"Be away till Sunday, all PM's out in a min if I'm not waiting!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T15:08:57-07:00","id":1126856,"title":"","content":"Post tomorrow! Been busy at work and with family","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-16T14:17:09-07:00","id":1129972,"title":"","content":"Not completely sure Aisa would share all the wedding details, but I wanted an excuse to post them, so there you all go. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, Aisa's reaaaaaaly wishing she were a sidereal right now. So many cool first age books and secrets and access to the Loom of Fate, and...<br /> <br /> :ahem:<br /> <br /> I mean, Dragon Blood is Best Blood. Yes, that's right. Serious Empress lady is not impressed by your nonsense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T14:43:15-07:00","id":1130497,"title":"","content":"Hey hey all, so planning to wrap up this week. I'll sort it all out you'll see.<br /> <br /> But since it's coming up in threads now I guess we gotta talk what I'm up to when it comes to the Setting.<br /> <br /> I'm not going to part too far from Canon and go into the wild depths, but this game was set a year before the Solar's return and I've taken that as a liberty to change a fair few things when it comes to Celestials and so it's only fair I tell you that, so you don't assume you know why the Solar's went away (Yes I changed that) or expect there to be no Abyssals (There are) or that all your plans will be messed up when the Jade Prison opens (Because the Jade Prison isn't even a thing in this game's history)<br /> <br /> Hopefully this is okay and I probably should have asked way earlier than this, felt it only fair to help out the IC/OOC divide a bit by letting you know that there's mysteries out there to solve about what happened to all the Celestials and it won't just be a case of reading the Core Book to find out what happened, which I felt would work better in a mainly social/investigative game.<br /> <br /> Sorry again! I BEG FOR FORGIVENESS.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T02:22:30-07:00","id":1130751,"title":"","content":"You told us about the meta changes when they started to matter so minimal confusion. Honestly the Core book overloaded us with how the meta worked and never really let people create cool conspiracy theories for stuff we'd actually run into. I always loved the idea that we didn't win the primordial war and the Malfeas prison is just an excuse for the primordials to keep an eye on creation even if it doesn't matter either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T05:40:50-07:00","id":1132167,"title":"","content":"Literally every ST I've ever had has rewritten the Exalted setting to suit their tastes in some small way or another.<br /> <br /> Makes things more interesting when you can't make assumptions about the Secret Cosmic History of the Universe. (Also, I'm with Eura on how there was too much meta right off the bat in the standard materials.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T11:27:59-07:00","id":1132308,"title":"","content":"Yeah but there's level of scale for changes and I feel &quot;Totally changing origin and history of most Celestial splats&quot; bears a mention <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T02:54:53-07:00","id":1132540,"title":"","content":"Be out Thursday until Monday. Get your letters in and Inmay be able to get the next week started before I go!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T06:25:16-07:00","id":1132581,"title":"","content":"I forgot to mention this, but the Artifact made was a pair of fate rings (artifact war fans) that mote steal death essence and do some sort of anti-undead explosion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-06T16:00:24-07:00","id":1138130,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the lack of PM's, I'd been stolen by X-Com and I'll get my head back in the game now.<br /> <br /> This one! Not X-Com.<br /> <br /> How do people feel about a new player? I've got interest, but we're pretty far along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-06T18:19:45-07:00","id":1138167,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with a new player as long as they meet the basis of the game at least half-way. No more Exthalions trying to break the game for their own fun please. Also I no longer feel bad about waiting forever for my PM since I wasn't the only one distracted by a video game (Baldur's gate).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T13:05:29-07:00","id":1144179,"title":"","content":"So time to speak up since you've probably noticed I've been slowing down. Sadly I think I'm gonna have to call it quits, I'm really struggling to keep it going and forcing it will just keep everyone waiting on me all the time. It's a rough game to run with so much going on and I've just not been able to put the work in it needs.<br /> <br /> It's been fun! Sorry to have a second GM up and bail on you though, I feel rotten for that D:<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T13:48:56-07:00","id":1144190,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it's super rough basically running three games all at once. I've enjoyed having you here a great deal. Thanks for all your effort!<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> That's one of the reasons I sort of liked the epistolary game, where it could be much more 'drawn down' with only a little bit of description + a dice roll or two to cover things that would normally be an entire scene. In theory it should have helped avoid burnout, but in practice... we'll, we've now burned out two STs.<br /> <br /> To the other players - what do you want to do next? Look for another new ST? Give it up and move on ( <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )? Something else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T15:01:53-07:00","id":1144540,"title":"","content":"Honestly I've been struggling to find things to do as well, I can't sit back and let someone else be the center of attention for a session or two to build inspiration back up like in a normal playstyle. I always had fun, but dear god could letters turn into a slog when both the player and the ST are struggling to figure out how the hell to make a specific thing interesting. Idk about you guys but sometimes I would know very quickly when I got a reply and wait a few days anyway because I had no idea what to write about..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}